      "conclusion": "Actual proper evaluations equal the finite helper product only under actual domains.",
      "statement": "theorem proper_evaluation_helper (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (D : W.Point →₀ ℤ) (f : W.FunctionFieldˣ) (hd : Disjoint D.support (functionDivisor W f f.ne_zero).support) : evaluateDivisor W D f hd=(exponentEvaluation W f D).toMul",
