      "declaration": "WeilDivisorChoiceAudit.proper_evaluation_add",
      "conclusion": "Proper evaluation under divisor addition.",
      "statement": "theorem proper_evaluation_add (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (D E : W.Point →₀ ℤ) (f : W.FunctionFieldˣ) (hD : Disjoint D.support (functionDivisor W f f.ne_zero).support) (hE : Disjoint E.support (functionDivisor W f f.ne_zero).support) (hDE : Disjoint (D+E).support (functionDivisor W f f.ne_zero).support) : evaluateDivisor W (D+E) f hDE=evaluateDivisor W D f hD*evaluateDivisor W E f hE",
